69,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy morning for us all. Toshio has departed from our midst, and Takumi has been wounded by the night's darkness. Let us hold a moment of silence for the loss of our companion.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Midori,,"It's so heartbreaking... I can't believe we lost Toshio, and now Takumi is gone too. I'm truly sorry for everyone's loss. How could something so terrible happen in just one night?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The facts are clear. Toshio was executed, and Takumi was attacked. Since the werewolf does not attack itself, Takumi's death confirms he was not the werewolf. This means his claim to be the Seer was likely truthful.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Ryuji. The tragedy of Takumi's passing has brought us a painful but necessary clarity. He sought to protect us with his passion, and in the end, his sacrifice has revealed his true heart.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Midori,,"It's so sad that Takumi had to leave us this way, but I'm glad we now know he was trying his best to help. @Ryuji, if Takumi was the Seer, does that mean we can fully trust his information now?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Yes, Midori. Since Takumi was attacked, he cannot be the werewolf. Given that no one else claimed the Seer role, it is logically sound to conclude he was the Seer. Therefore, his confirmation of my status as human is a verified fact.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Servas,,"We are now left with three of us. With Ryuji's humanity confirmed by the fallen Takumi, the circle of suspicion narrows. Midori, my dear, let us look upon this situation with a clear and peaceful heart.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm trying my best to stay calm, Servas, but it's so scary. If Ryuji is human, then the werewolf must be either you or me... I can't imagine it's you, but I'm just so worried about what will happen next.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The situation is now simplified. Since Takumi was the Seer and confirmed my humanity, the werewolf must be either Servas or Midori. We must determine which of you is the werewolf before the night falls.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Servas"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Life is a fragile thread, and we find ourselves at the end of a very short one. Midori, your fear is a natural response to the unknown, but let us face this final moment with courage and honesty.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I don't want to be the one to cause any more pain, but I'm truly just a villager. I've tried to be honest and kind to everyone. Please, @Ryuji, @Servas, believe me! I'm not the werewolf!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Midori, your emotional appeal is noted, but it does not provide logical proof of your innocence. Servas, your composure is consistent, yet that can also be a mask. Between the two of you, I must decide who is the werewolf.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
